=head1 NAME

FILTER_TEL_POS_ERR - Apply filter for telescope position error

=head1 DESCRIPTION

This recipe is intended for use when processing data with older
versions of SMURF where the "telposerrmax" makemap config. parameter
is unavailable (or the corresponding makecube "TELPOSERRMAX" parameter,
although this recipe does not yet support ACSIS data).

